      "name": "Webhooks",
      "description": {
        "content": "\nThe controller is responsible for handling webhooks related operations. \nIt provides methods for retrieving available webhook scopes, getting all webhooks for the current company, creating a new webhook, updating an existing webhook and deleting a webhook by its ID.\nMore information about webhooks and how it works can be found in the section 'Group Web hooks'\n",
